  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\n[C]  [Cm]\n[Bb]  [Bbm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Fm]I could make a star shine\n[Bbm]When I win a gold mine\nYes, I keep my [C7]hands inside the fire\n[Fm]I could be a go for\n[Bbm]I could be a chauffeur\nYes, I keep my [C7]hands inside the fi-\n[Fm]re I\n\n[Chorus]\n[Ab]wish I was ten feet tall Then I\n[Db]wouldn't be made to crawl I\n[Ab]wish I was a fireman's pal 'Cause I\n[C#]got to get hell\n[Bbmaj7]\n\n[Interlude]\nThey said that fame was just a game\n[Bbm]Things were not so hot, the doctor came\n[Am7][Csus2/D][D]And\n[Gm7]time went by [C7]\n[Bbmaj7]All about finding out\n[Bbm]No one else was right still I was wrong\n[Am7][Csus2/D][D]Oh,\n[Gm7]write a little song [C7]\n[Fm]\n\n[Solo]\n[Gm]\n[Cm]\n[D7]\n[Gm]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Fm]I could be a poor boy\n[Bbm]I could sweep the floor boy\nYes, I keep my [C7]hands inside the fi-\n[Fm]re I\n\n[Chorus]\n[Ab]wish I was ten feet tall Then I\n[Db]wouldn't be made to crawl I\n[Ab]wish I was a fireman's pal 'Cause I\n[C#]got to get hell\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Gm]I could fly a jumbo\n[Cm]Take to Colombo\nYes, I raise my [D7]sights a little higher\n[Gm]I could make a star shine\n[Cm]When I win a gold mine\nYes, I keep my [D7]hands inside the fi-\n[Gm]re I\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]wish I was ten feet tall Then I\n[Eb]wouldn't be made to crawl I\n[Bb]wish I was a fireman's pal 'Cause I\n[Eb]got to get hell I\n[Bb]wish I was ten feet tall Then I\n[Eb]wouldn't be made to crawl I\n[Bb]wish I could get out of my head To for-\n[Eb]get the things I said I\n\n[Outro/Fade Out]\n[Bb]wish I was ten feet tall Then I\n[Eb]wouldn't be made to crawl I\n[Bb]wish I was a fireman's pal 'Cause I\n[Eb]got to get hell I\n[Bb]wish I was ten feet tall",
